  "comment": "Every Wayland global that the Gnoblin compositor can register: the 44 of Mutter and libwayland and the 13 of Gnoblin. The runtime layer expects an interface when the installed binaries hold its name, unless it has a container reason. A release with an older libwayland or wayland-protocols compiles some interfaces out (wl_fixes needs libwayland 1.24), so its binaries do not hold the name and the interface is not expected. design/package-testing.md, R2.",
